  only Alliance
  zone Dustwallow Marsh
  tip Artisan Tailoring raises the cap to 300; it needs skill 200 and level 35. Timothy Worthington in Theramore, Dustwallow Marsh, teaches it. Train it now: only the Artisan trainers teach the Black Mageweave Shoulders.
