  tip Heavy Silken Thread (44) and Red Dye (34) for the shoulders and bags, from any Tailoring Supply vendor. Stranglethorn Seed (50) from Reagent vendors goes to the Lesser Wizard Oil; the Leaded Vials you bought for the Minor Mana Oil cover it.
