  craft 13702 "Runed Truesilver Rod" x1

step Lesser Wizard Oil (Enchanting 201-220)
  tip Lesser Wizard Oil, 25 to Enchanting 220: 1 Vision Dust, 2 Stranglethorn Seed and 1 Leaded Vial each. You still hold the Leaded Vials from the Minor Mana Oil shopping; buy a few more if you ran short.
