  craft 25126 "Lesser Wizard Oil" until 220

step Bolt of Runecloth (205-215)
  tip Bolt of Runecloth, 317 bolts: 5 Runecloth each. About 23 of them take you to 215; make all 317 now, the belts, gloves and cuffs take 311 of them, and the last 6 go to the Threading a Solution quest below (Horde). Keep every bolt.
  learn 18401 "Bolt of Runecloth"
  craft 18401 "Bolt of Runecloth" x317

step Red Mageweave Bag (215-225)
  tip Red Mageweave Bag, 17 bags to 225: 4 Bolt of Mageweave, 2 Red Dye and 2 Heavy Silken Thread each. The bags sell well to a vendor, which is why the route picks them; bags cannot be disenchanted. If you would rather not make bags, 10 Runecloth Belts (30 Bolt of Runecloth, 10 Rune Thread) cover the same points and give you something to disenchant.
  learn 12079 "Red Mageweave Bag"
  craft 12079 "Red Mageweave Bag" until 225

step Enchant Cloak - Greater Defense (Enchanting 220-225)
  tip Enchant Cloak - Greater Defense, 5 to Enchanting 225: 1 Vision Dust each. Both professions now sit at 225: claim the Legacy Points for Tailoring and for Enchanting.
  learn 13746 "Enchant Cloak - Greater Defense"
  craft 13746 "Enchant Cloak - Greater Defense" until 225

section Tailoring 225-280

step Annora in Uldaman
  zone Badlands
  tip Artisan Enchanting raises the cap to 300; it needs skill 200 and level 35, and costs 5 gold. Annora in Uldaman is the only Artisan Enchanting trainer. Uldaman is in the Badlands: use the back entrance, in the south of the zone. It cannot be soloed at level 35: go with a party, or ask a level 60 to help. Annora only spawns once you kill every mob in the area she is in. Bring enough gold to learn every recipe and enough materials to reach 250 (around 50 Vision Dust), or you must return for the higher recipes. Do not leave without learning them all: the recipes from 230 up are taught nowhere else.
  goto 65.2,43.5 live "Uldaman back entrance"
  enter "Uldaman"
  level 35
  train Enchanting Artisan npc 11073
  learn 13815 "Enchant Gloves - Agility" npc 11073
  learn 13917 "Enchant Chest - Superior Intellect" npc 11073
  learn 13905 "Enchant Shield - Greater Spirit" npc 11073
  learn 13935 "Enchant Boots - Agility" npc 11073
  learn 13937 "Enchant 2H Weapon - Greater Impact" npc 11073
  learn 13939 "Enchant Bracer - Greater Strength" npc 11073
  learn 13941 "Enchant Chest - Stats" npc 11073
  learn 13943 "Enchant Weapon - Greater Striking" npc 11073
  learn 13948 "Enchant Gloves - Minor Haste" npc 11073
  learn 17181 "Enchanted Leather" npc 11073
  learn 17180 "Enchanted Thorium" npc 11073

step Formula: Lesser Mana Oil
  tip Formula: Lesser Mana Oil, for the Enchanting 250 band. Kania in Silithus (upstairs in the inn) sells it for 1 gold. Both of her formulas need level 40. Buy Formula: Wizard Oil from her too: it is needed at Enchanting 275.
  buy 20754 x1 nearest

step Formula: Wizard Oil
  tip Formula: Wizard Oil, needed at Enchanting 275. Kania in Silithus sells it for 2 gold.
  buy 20755 x1 nearest

step Formula: Enchant Shield - Greater Stamina
  tip Formula: Enchant Shield - Greater Stamina, for the Enchanting 270 band. Sold by Daniel Bartlett (Undercity) and Mythrin'dir (Darnassus) for 1 gold 20 silver. It binds when picked up: do not buy it on an alt.
  buy 16217 x1 nearest

step Tailoring 225-280: vendor goods
  tip Rune Thread for the belts, gloves and cuffs: 74, from any Tailoring Supply vendor. Crystal Vial for the Lesser Mana Oil: 26, from any Alchemy Supply vendor (Mishta in Silithus sells them too).
  buy 14341 x74 nearest
  buy 8925 x26 nearest

step Tailoring 225-280: Auction House
  tip What 225-280 takes that the Auction House sells: 44 Rugged Leather and 39 Ironweb Spider Silk for Tailoring; 34 Vision Dust, 56 Dream Dust and 26 Purple Lotus for Enchanting. The counts drop by what your bags, bank and mail hold.
  auction 8170 x44
  auction 14227 x39
  auction 11137 x34
  auction 11176 x56
  auction 8831 x26

step Rugged Leather
  tip Rugged Leather comes from skinning beasts of level 47-60, or take it from your bank.
  collect 8170 x44 anywhere gather Skinning 240

step Ironweb Spider Silk
  only Alliance
  zone Western Plaguelands
  tip Ironweb Spider Silk drops from Plague Lurkers (level 54-55) at the marked spot in Western Plaguelands.
  collect 14227 x39 @57.1,53.5 era gather levels 54-55

step Ironweb Spider Silk
  only Horde
  zone Silithus
  tip Ironweb Spider Silk drops from Rock Stalkers (level 57-59) at the marked spot in Silithus.
  collect 14227 x39 @24.7,81.8 era gather levels 57-59

step Vision Dust and Dream Dust
  tip Vision Dust and Dream Dust come from disenchanting greens and blues of item level 31 and up. Your Runecloth Belts, Gloves and Cuffs below are green: disenchant them, and treat the dust as a rebate on the cloth.
  collect 11137 x34 anywhere gather Enchanting 1
  collect 11176 x56 anywhere gather Enchanting 1

step Runecloth Belt (225-240)
  tip Runecloth Belt, 24 belts to 240: 3 Bolt of Runecloth and 1 Rune Thread each. Disenchant them for Vision and Dream Dust.
  learn 18402 "Runecloth Belt" npc 11052 only Alliance
  learn 18402 "Runecloth Belt" npc 2399 only Horde
  craft 18402 "Runecloth Belt" until 240

step Pattern: Runecloth Gloves
  tip Pattern: Runecloth Gloves, for the next band. Qia in Winterspring sells it for 1g 60s.
  buy 14481 x1 nearest

step Runecloth Gloves (240-250)
  tip Runecloth Gloves, 11 to 250: 4 Bolt of Runecloth, 4 Rugged Leather and 1 Rune Thread each. If you hold Pattern: Brightcloth Cloak instead, 11 Brightcloth Cloaks (44 Bolt of Runecloth, 22 Gold Bar, 11 Rune Thread) cover the same points.
  learn 18417 "Runecloth Gloves"
  craft 18417 "Runecloth Gloves" until 250

step Enchant Gloves - Agility (Enchanting 225-250)
  tip Enchant Gloves - Agility, 34 to Enchanting 250: 1 Vision Dust each. Annora taught it: learn it on that visit. Yellow from 230: make a few more if you come up short of 250. Do these in between the Tailoring crafts above whenever the dust is in your bags.
  craft 13815 "Enchant Gloves - Agility" until 250

step Threading a Solution
  only Horde
  zone Mount Hyjal
  tip Threading a Solution: Kal'tinzan in Elderwild, Mount Hyjal, wants 6 Bolt of Runecloth (made with the bulk bolts above). It needs level 54, and you should finish Blight No More in Mount Hyjal first. The reward is Pattern: Runecloth Cuffs. Alliance players skip this step and buy the pattern from Pexmit instead.
  level 54
  accept 95769
  collect 14048 x6 quest 95769.1
  turnin 95769
  learn 1257487 "Runecloth Cuffs"

step Pattern: Runecloth Cuffs
  when !knows 1257487
  tip Pattern: Runecloth Cuffs, for the next band. Pexmit in Mount Hyjal sells it for 10g. It binds when picked up, so buy it with the leveling character. Horde players who did Threading a Solution above already have it and skip this step.
  buy 254124 x1 npc 266901
  learn 1257487 "Runecloth Cuffs"

step Runecloth Cuffs (250-280)
  tip Runecloth Cuffs, 39 to 280: 5 Bolt of Runecloth, 1 Ironweb Spider Silk and 1 Rune Thread each. Disenchant the cuffs as you go to feed the Enchanting 250-300 stretch. If the Cuffs pattern cannot be got at all, buy Pattern: Runecloth Shoulders on the Auction House instead: make Runecloth Gloves to 260 (19 more: 76 Bolt of Runecloth, 76 Rugged Leather, 19 Rune Thread), then Runecloth Shoulders to 280 (21: 147 Bolt of Runecloth, 42 Ironweb Spider Silk, 84 Rugged Leather, 21 Rune Thread). More expensive, but the Shoulders continue to 300.
  craft 1257487 "Runecloth Cuffs" until 280

step Lesser Mana Oil (Enchanting 250-270)
  tip Lesser Mana Oil, 26 to Enchanting 270: 1 Dream Dust, 1 Purple Lotus and 1 Crystal Vial each. If you have no Purple Lotus, make Enchant Bracer - Greater Strength instead (1 Dream Dust, 2 Lesser Nether Essence each); Annora teaches it.
  learn 25127 "Lesser Mana Oil"
  craft 25127 "Lesser Mana Oil" until 270

step Enchant Shield - Greater Stamina (Enchanting 270-275)
  tip Enchant Shield - Greater Stamina, 5 to Enchanting 275: 6 Dream Dust each. These are made again at 295.
  learn 20017 "Enchant Shield - Greater Stamina"
  craft 20017 "Enchant Shield - Greater Stamina" until 275

