step Illusion Dust and Essences
  tip Illusion Dust, Dream Dust, the Greater Eternal Essence and the Brilliant Shards all come from disenchanting greens and blues of item level 31 and up: your Runecloth Shoulders below are green, and every drop in the 50s adds to the pile. Firebloom and the rods are bought; the Arcanite Rod comes from a Blacksmith.
  collect 11176 x48 anywhere gather Enchanting 1
  collect 16204 x88 anywhere gather Enchanting 1
  collect 16203 x4 anywhere gather Enchanting 1
  collect 14343 x4 anywhere gather Enchanting 1
  collect 14344 x2 anywhere gather Enchanting 1

step Wizard Oil (Enchanting 275-295)
  tip Wizard Oil, 26 to Enchanting 295: 3 Illusion Dust, 2 Firebloom and 1 Crystal Vial each. If Illusion Dust is expensive, make 23 Shields instead (138 Dream Dust). From 290 the Runed Arcanite Rod can be made.
  learn 25128 "Wizard Oil"
  craft 25128 "Wizard Oil" until 295

step Runecloth Shoulders (280-300)
  tip Runecloth Shoulders, 58 to 300: 7 Bolt of Runecloth, 2 Ironweb Spider Silk, 4 Rugged Leather and 1 Rune Thread each. Pattern: Runecloth Shoulders is a world drop: buy it on the Auction House. Make the 406 bolts first; they give no points this late, they are just the material. Disenchant the green shoulders for Illusion Dust. Alternatives for the same band: 58 Wizardweave Turbans (348 Bolt of Runecloth, 232 Dream Dust, 58 Star Ruby) if that rare pattern turns up on the Auction House. To 290 only: 42 Runecloth Headbands (168 Bolt of Runecloth, 84 Ironweb Spider Silk) or 42 Runecloth Cuffs (210 Bolt of Runecloth, 42 Ironweb Spider Silk). The Loom recipes need another tailor's Loom (you can only make one at 300): with Cenarion Circle standing and Mishta's patterns from Silithus, Swarmtender's or Venomspew Gloves 285-290, Cords 290-295, Footpads 295-300.
  learn 18449 "Runecloth Shoulders"
  craft 18401 "Bolt of Runecloth" x406
  craft 18449 "Runecloth Shoulders" until 300

step Enchant Shield - Greater Stamina (Enchanting 295-299)
  tip Enchant Shield - Greater Stamina, 8 more to Enchanting 299: 6 Dream Dust each. If Wizard Oil sells well, keep making oils instead (around 15).
  craft 20017 "Enchant Shield - Greater Stamina" until 299

step Formula: Runed Arcanite Rod
  tip Formula: Runed Arcanite Rod, for the last Enchanting point. Lorelae Wintersong in Moonglade (Nighthaven) sells it for 2 gold 20 silver.
  buy 16243 x1 nearest

step Runed Arcanite Rod (Enchanting 299-300)
  tip Runed Arcanite Rod, 1 craft to Enchanting 300: 1 Arcanite Rod, 1 Golden Pearl, 10 Illusion Dust, 4 Greater Eternal Essence, 4 Small Brilliant Shard and 2 Large Brilliant Shard. It can be made from 290, and most recipes at 300 need it in your bags. With Tailoring 300 and Enchanting 300 you now hold all 6 Legacy Points from the two crafters.
  learn 20051 "Runed Arcanite Rod"
  craft 20051 "Runed Arcanite Rod" x1
